  "body": "**A locate draft can take a viewport release in the same frame its page is hidden.**\n\n#566 (7338fbd4) drops a locate draft whose form wasn't drawn, via `locate_pick::sweep`, which runs **after** the dock.\n\n**The gap** (found by the #668 work):\n- a viewport pick fires on mouse **release**;\n- a layout change that hides the Properties pane applies **before** the dock (`layout::settle`). A keyboard panel toggle while the button is held does it;\n- so the press lands while the form is shown and the release lands in the frame the page is hidden. The viewport routes that release to the still-live draft before the sweep runs.\n\n**Fix:**\n- once #668 (`layout::is_shown`, plus the pre-dock `disarm_all` for setup picks) and #566 are both on main, add the locate draft to #668's **pre-dock** check: if Properties isn't shown, drop `locate_pick` too;\n- pin it with #668's same-frame test shape (`a_click_in_the_frame_the_pane_hides_misses_the_hidden_draft`), using a locate draft.\n\n**Done means:** that test, written for a locate draft, fails without the pre-dock drop and passes with it.\n\nDepends on #566 and #668.\n",
